  "description": "Array of 8 NPN Darlington pairs with high-voltage open-collector outputs and common-cathode clamp diodes brought out to the COM pin. Each channel includes a 2.7k series base resistor for direct operation from TTL or 5V CMOS logic. Each output sinks up to 500mA at outputs rated to 50V, driving relays, solenoids, steppers, lamps and LED/gas-discharge displays. The 8-channel sibling of the ULN2003, common on relay and motor boards.",
