  "typical_application": "Sinking 8 relays, solenoids or a multiplexed display matrix from a microcontroller or shift register.",
  "gotchas": [
    "COM pin must connect to the inductive load's positive supply for the internal flyback diodes to clamp",
    "outputs SINK current (active-low drive); the load connects between V+ and the output",
    "cannot source current; not for driving loads referenced to ground",
    "pin 9 is GND (note this differs from ULN2003 where the common emitter is pin 8)",
